    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></math> be an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> If the sum of this <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>189</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></math> is equal to :"
