  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;[let common difference of&#160;</mtext><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>AP</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>20</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now sum of first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn></math> terms<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>189</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>by using equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math> otherwise <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>16</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p>"
